{
  "//": "Indices compuestos de Krealo Shift. Uno por cada consulta que la app hace de verdad: se extrajeron leyendo las cadenas .eq/.gte/.lt/.order de src/ Y las .where/.orderBy de functions/. Las dos mitades: derivarlos solo del cliente dejo tres consultas del servidor sin indice y la primera se manifesto como un 500. En Firestore una consulta sin su indice NO se degrada, falla; y es mejor asi, porque la alternativa es que ordene en memoria y mienta.",
  "indexes": [
    {
      "//": "Equipo: la lista de empleados de la empresa, por nombre.",
      "collectionGroup": "employees",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "organization_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "full_name",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "job_roles",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "organization_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "name",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "locations",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "organization_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "name",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Arranque de sesion: a que organizacion pertenece quien acaba de entrar.",
      "collectionGroup": "organization_memberships",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "user_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "created_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Horario semanal de una tienda. La consulta mas usada de la app.",
      "collectionGroup": "shifts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "location_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "starts_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Turnos de una persona. `status` va como IN de dos valores y no como != porque con dos desigualdades (status y starts_at) Firestore obliga a ordenar primero por ellas, y el orden que la pantalla necesita es por hora de inicio.",
      "collectionGroup": "shifts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "employee_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "starts_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "shifts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "organization_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "starts_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Ultima version publicada de la semana de una tienda.",
      "collectionGroup": "shift_publications",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "location_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "week_starts_on",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "publication_version",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Fichajes de una persona en un rango de fechas (hoja de horas).",
      "collectionGroup": "time_events",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "employee_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "occurred_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Estado de asistencia actual: el ultimo evento de la persona. `seq` desempata cuando dos comparten instante, igual que en Postgres.",
      "collectionGroup": "time_events",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "employee_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "occurred_at",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "seq",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "time_events",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "location_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "occurred_at",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Sesiones de trabajo de una tienda en la semana.",
      "collectionGroup": "work_sessions",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "location_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "starts_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "work_sessions",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "employee_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "starts_at",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Solicitudes 'Olvide marcar' de una tienda, las nuevas primero.",
      "collectionGroup": "time_edit_requests",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "organization_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "location_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "created_at",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Cola del enviador de alertas: lo pendiente, en orden de llegada.",
      "collectionGroup": "manager_alert_deliveries",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "queued_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Auditoria de la empresa, lo mas reciente arriba.",
      "collectionGroup": "audit_logs",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "organization_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "created_at",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Canje de un codigo de activacion: los vivos y sin usar. LO DESCUBRIO UN 500 EN PRODUCCION, no una revision: los 16 indices de arriba salieron de leer las consultas del CLIENTE, y esta la escribe el SERVIDOR. Derivar los indices de un solo lado deja el otro sin cubrir, y el sintoma es `INTERNAL` en la funcion, no un aviso.",
      "collectionGroup": "kiosk_activation_codes",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "used_count",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "expires_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Lo que el kiosco le ensena a una persona tras su PIN: sus solicitudes ya resueltas.",
      "collectionGroup": "time_edit_requests",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "employee_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "created_at",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Pausas por motivo de una tienda en un rango: el grafico de «en que se va el tiempo».",
      "collectionGroup": "time_events",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "organization_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "location_id",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "occurred_at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "fieldOverrides": []
}
